When they saw the star, they were filled with joy.
The wise men came to the house, and they saw the child with his mother Mary, so they greeted him and worshipped him. Then they opened their treasures, and they presented to him gold and wine and oil and spices.
But God sent them a message in a dream, telling them not to return to Herod's territory. So they returned to their own country by another route. Thus, Jesus's family fled to Egypt.
When the wise gentlemen departed, a dream came upon Joseph. In the dream, a multitude of the mercy of God appeared to him. And the multitude said to him, "Arise! Lift up the child and his mother and flee into Egypt, and remain there until I tell you to return. Herod will await the child, and he desires to kill him."
