Jesus commanded the demon to leave the boy, and it departed from him. And he was healed at that moment.
The Muslims came to Jesus in secret. And he asked him: "Why have we not cast out the devil?"
He answered, "Because your faith is very weak. What I am going to tell you now is the truth. If your faith is as weak as a cumin seed, it is enough. You can say to this mountain, 'Move from here to there,' and it will move. Nothing will be impossible for you."
